 "text": "Hey, how was your day? Well, it depends. The most effective method is to immerse yourself in the native language as much as possible. That means watching TV shows, movies, and even listening to music. That's fine. Just start with easy stuff. You'll eventually pick up the language as you practice more and more. It's a matter of preference. Some people start with one episode a week, while others go for three or four. Just find what works best for you. Great. Good luck with your language learning journey.",
